SUMMARY:SFC Education: 3 things to save before tax season 👀
DESCRIPTION:FORMAT: Carousel + TikTok talk-through\nGOAL: Saves + trust\n\nIG/FB CAPTION:\nTax season feels a whole lot less chaotic when you don’t wait until January to figure out where everything went. 😭\n\nStart a folder now and keep your income forms\, childcare or education documents if they apply to you\, and your business income + expense records all in one place.\n\nNothing fancy. A folder on your phone\, computer\, or a physical folder works.\n\nWe’re getting organized before tax season starts yelling at us this year 😂💼\n\nSave this post so you can come back to it later.\n\n📍 DFW + Virtual throughout Texas\n@serenityfinancialco\nLess stress. More clarity.\n\nTIKTOK: We’re not doing the January document scavenger hunt this year 😂💼 Save this & start your tax folder now.\nCTA: Save this post.\nSTORY: Poll — Do you already have a tax folder? YES / Girl… no 😭\nHASHTAGS: #DFWTaxPreparer #TexasTaxPreparer #TaxTips #TaxTok #DFWSmallBusiness #SmallBusinessTaxes
