SUMMARY:SFC Trust: Building Serenity Financial Co.
DESCRIPTION:FORMAT: Founder photo or BTS\nGOAL: Trust + founder connection\n\nVISUAL TEXT: Building Serenity Financial Co. from the ground up 💼\n\nIG/FB CAPTION:\nA little behind-the-scenes moment because Serenity Financial Co. is still very much in the building stage. 💼✨\n\nI’m preparing for the 2027 tax season\, tightening up my systems\, continuing my training\, creating client resources\, and making sure the experience feels clear from the first question to the final next step.\n\nI don’t want SFC to feel intimidating or overly complicated.\n\nI want you to feel comfortable asking the question you think you “should already know\,” understand what’s happening with your return\, and leave with more clarity than you came with.\n\nWe’re building this one thoughtful step at a time. 💛\n\n📍 DFW + Virtual throughout Texas\n@serenityfinancialco\nLess stress. More clarity.\n\nTIKTOK IDEA: B-roll of laptop\, planner\, training notes\, branding\, coffee. Overlay: “Building my tax business before tax season gets loud.”\nTIKTOK CAPTION: Quietly building the systems now so tax season feels less chaotic later 💼✨\nCTA: Follow the journey.\nSTORY: Question box — What’s one thing you wish tax preparers explained better?\nHASHTAGS: #DFWTaxPreparer #TexasTaxPreparer #SmallBusinessJourney #TaxBusiness #WomenInBusiness
