SUMMARY:SFC Education: Started a side hustle this year?
DESCRIPTION:FORMAT: Carousel or talking video\nGOAL: Attract self-employed + gig workers\n\nCAROUSEL: Track money coming in / business expenses / receipts + invoices / mileage or business-use records when applicable.\n\nIG/FB CAPTION:\nStarted a side hustle this year? 👀 Then please don’t wait until tax season to start trying to remember what happened.\n\nWhether you’re doing hair\, nails\, delivery apps\, photography\, selling products\, freelancing\, or running a small business\, start keeping up with:\n\n✔️ money coming in\n✔️ business purchases and expenses\n✔️ receipts and invoices\n✔️ mileage or business-use records when applicable\n\nYou do NOT need some fancy system to start. A simple folder + consistent tracking is already better than trying to rebuild an entire year from memory in January. 😭\n\nSave this for later and send it to your side-hustle friend.\n\n@serenityfinancialco\nLess stress. More clarity.\n\nTIKTOK HOOK: If your side hustle made money this year\, stop scrolling for 20 seconds.\nTIKTOK CAPTION: Your side hustle needs records before it needs cute spreadsheets 😂 Start simple.\nCTA: Save + share.\nSTORY: Question box — What kind of side hustle do you have?\nHASHTAGS: #SelfEmployedTaxes #SideHustleTips #TexasSmallBusiness #DFWSmallBusiness #TaxTok
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
