SUMMARY:SFC Campaign: Countdown to Tax Season
DESCRIPTION:FORMAT: Branded countdown graphic\nGOAL: Early tax-season awareness\n\nIG/FB CAPTION:\nTax season might feel far away right now\, but January has a funny way of pulling up FAST. 😭💼\n\nSo we’re getting ahead of it this year.\n\nNow is a good time to start:\n✔️ gathering important documents\n✔️ organizing income records\n✔️ keeping up with business expenses\n✔️ writing down questions you want answered before filing\n\nYou don’t have to know everything right now.\n\nYou just don’t want January to arrive and have you digging through emails\, drawers\, screenshots and the glove compartment looking for paperwork. 😂\n\nSerenity Financial Co. is getting ready for the 2027 tax season\, and I’m taking y’all along with me.\n\n📍 DFW + Virtual throughout Texas\n@serenityfinancialco\nLess stress. More clarity.\n\nTIKTOK: January is gonna pull up whether we’re ready or not 😂💼 Tax season 2027 is loading…\nCTA: Follow + save.\nSTORY: Countdown sticker + poll — Organized yet? YES / NOT YET\nHASHTAGS: #DFWTaxPreparer #TexasTaxPreparer #TaxPreparation #TaxSeason2027 #TaxTips
