SUMMARY:SFC LegalShield: Need extra peace of mind?
DESCRIPTION:FORMAT: Branded graphic + Story\nGOAL: Introduce LegalShield naturally\n\nIG/FB CAPTION:\nOne thing I’m big on is having somewhere to turn when you have a question and don’t even know where to start.\n\nBecause sometimes the problem isn’t taxes.\n\nSometimes it’s a contract.\nA letter you received.\nAn identity-related concern.\nA small-business question.\nOr one of those situations where you’re sitting there thinking…\n\n“Do I need to talk to somebody about this?” 😭\n\nThat’s why I also offer LegalShield as an optional resource alongside Serenity Financial Co.\n\nIt can provide access to legal support through participating provider law firms\, depending on the membership selected.\n\nYou don’t have to already be in a crisis to want peace of mind.\n\nIf you’ve been curious about LegalShield or want to know how the memberships work\, send me “LEGAL” and I’ll send you the information. ⚖️💛\n\n@serenityfinancialco\nLess stress. More clarity.\n\nTIKTOK: Not every stressful situation is a tax situation 😭 Sometimes you just need to know who to call. DM “LEGAL” for info.\nCTA: DM LEGAL.\nSTORY: Poll — Would easier access to legal help give you peace of mind? YES / TELL ME MORE\nDISCLOSURE: I’m a LegalShield Independent Associate\, not an attorney. Benefits and exclusions vary by plan.\nHASHTAGS: #LegalShield #SmallBusinessSupport #TexasSmallBusiness #DFWSmallBusiness #FinancialClarity
