SUMMARY:SFC Education: Small business owners\, keep up with these now
DESCRIPTION:FORMAT: Carousel\nGOAL: Small-business audience + LegalShield crossover\n\nCAROUSEL: Income records / business expenses / receipts + supporting documents / important agreements + contracts.\n\nIG/FB CAPTION:\nSmall business owners\, your future self would like a word. 😂💼\n\nPlease start keeping these four things organized before tax season gets here:\n\n1. Income records\n2. Business expenses\n3. Receipts + supporting documents\n4. Important agreements and contracts\n\nThe goal is not perfection. It’s being able to find what you need without reconstructing your whole year from screenshots and memory. 😭\n\nAnd if legal questions start popping up around your business\, I also offer LegalShield as an optional resource for access to legal support through participating provider law firms\, depending on the membership.\n\nSave this one.\n\n@serenityfinancialco\nLess stress. More clarity.\n\nTIKTOK: Your business records should not be living in 47 screenshots and a prayer 😂\nCTA: Save this post.\nSTORY: Poll — Are your business records organized? YES / GIRL…\nHASHTAGS: #SmallBusinessTaxes #DFWSmallBusiness #TexasSmallBusiness #BusinessOwnerTips #TaxTok #LegalShield
